<title>FRANCE: Air Macau acquires two Airbus A321 planes.</title>
<headline>Air Macau acquires two Airbus A321 planes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airline company Air Macau has acquired two Airbus A321 narrow-body planes, European aircraft consortium Airbus Industrie said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The new aircraft will be delivered in early 1997.</p>
</text>
